# release|slot — while a release holds its card, this slot stands in on ANOTHER card.
#
# The big model lives on card 0; a game takes card 0 (`free-c0`). The stand-in starts
# on card 1 (card 1's guests yield to it, like to any slot) and stops when the release
# ends, so card 1's guests come back. It is never declared: `restore` still returns to
# what served before the game.
free-c0|assistant-27b-c1
